## Lane answer: `index_test` runs on BOTH lanes

`shadow-cljs.edn`'s `:test` build is `:node-test` with **no** `:ns-regex`/`:entries` filter and `test/` is in
the `:cljs` alias's `:extra-paths`, so `yin.repl.index-test` compiles into `target/node-tests.js` (its only
reader conditionals are `#?(:cljd …)`). I therefore ran it on node **and** on the JVM — the JVM run also
covers the lane where the QA brief recorded the same red ("confirmed on BOTH lanes").

